# My Fitness 365 — environment example (v1)
# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Only PUBLIC client values belong here.
# NEVER put the Supabase service_role key in any VITE_ variable: everything
# prefixed VITE_ is bundled into the browser.
#
# Leave both blank to run in clearly-labelled LOCAL-ONLY mode
# (data, including progress photos, stays in this browser's IndexedDB).
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# Strava (optional). Create an API application at https://www.strava.com/settings/api
# with "Authorization Callback Domain" set to your site's domain.
# The Client ID is public and goes here:
VITE_STRAVA_CLIENT_ID=
# The Client Secret is NOT a VITE_ variable. Set these two only in Netlify →
# Site configuration → Environment variables (used by netlify/functions):
#   STRAVA_CLIENT_ID=...
#   STRAVA_CLIENT_SECRET=...
